	"Description": "Hi everyone&#33;\r<br />\r<br />So, I&#39;ve been working on some of the buildings. I&#39;ve recolored them to be Red, Orange, Green, Blue, Teal, Pink, Magenta, Indigo, Purple, Black, and Brown. If you downloaded the first version of these, I have fixed some stray pixel errors, and overhauled all images. So it may behoove you to redownload.\r<br />\r<br />[b]The buildings that have been recolored are thus :[/b]\r<br />\r<br />Coop\r<br />Big Coop\r<br />Deluxe Coop\r<br />Barn\r<br />Big Barn\r<br />Deluxe Barn\r<br />House 1, 2, 3\r<br />Greenhouse\r<br />Silo\r<br />Stable\r<br />Well\r<br />\r<br />Example -\u00A0\r<br />[img]http://i.imgur.com/X5BBFj1.png[/img]\r<br />\r<br />\r<br />[b]To Install :\u00A0[/b]\r<br />Please make a backup for your buildings folder, then unrar to Content/Buildings.\r<br />\r<br />If you want the alt textures, they are included in the rar file under /alt\r<br />\r<br />Alternative Textures -\u00A0\r<br />Smaller Silos :\u00A0\r<br />[img]http://i.imgur.com/nyiWeJU.png[/img]\r<br />\r<br />And third level brick house :\u00A0\r<br />[img]http://i.imgur.com/q30kDrP.png[/img]\r<br />\r<br />Enjoy&#33;\u00A0",
